{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11106170","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11106170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1110617001:0":{"text":"와! 먼저 한 방을 날린 건 오우거네요! 과연 브루투스는 어떻게 피해 갈까요?","source_cn":"哦哦！先出招的是奥格！布鲁特斯会如何化解？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71C17EBE5736C5A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1110617002:0":{"text":"빈틈이 없네요! 브루투스가 공격을 했어요. 공격은 최선의 방어이죠. 이 장면은 마치 그 당시의 장면을 재연한 듯하네요!","source_cn":"重剑无锋！布鲁特斯以攻为守——这一幕，活脱脱就是当年的翻版！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56A4146221ED2F39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110617003:0":{"text":"이번 군가 축제의 결승전을 미리 보는 듯한 느낌이군요! 여러분! 박수 소리가 너무 약해요!","source_cn":"这可能是本届决赛的提前上演！朋友们，你们的掌声还不够响亮！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25F284FC96285AB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:曼卡拉":{"text":"칼라","source":"曼卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}